WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.672 --> 00:00:13.778
"King Trog is City Hall?"

2
00:00:14.138 --> 00:00:14.799
Roxy asked.

3
00:00:15.619 --> 00:00:16.900
"What is he doing there?"

4
00:00:16.920 --> 00:00:20.942
"He thinks he's the king of everything," Detective Smith said.

5
00:00:20.962 --> 00:00:23.183
"We can find Professor Beard later.

6
00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:26.025
Right now we have to Rocket Girl?"

7
00:00:27.806 --> 00:00:29.647
Roxy saw a crowd in front of City Hall.

8
00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:32.028
Everyone looked scared.

9
00:00:33.564 --> 00:00:35.906
A tall caveman stood on the steps of the building.

10
00:00:37.927 --> 00:00:39.608
He carried a pouch and a wooden club.

11
00:00:40.229 --> 00:00:41.950
A gold ring sparkled on his finger.

12
00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:44.312
"The missing ring!"

13
00:00:44.712 --> 00:00:45.352
Roxy thought.

14
00:00:47.074 --> 00:00:49.075
"I am King Trog!"

15
00:00:49.736 --> 00:00:51.357
The caveman pounded his chest.

16
00:00:52.117 --> 00:00:53.578
Mayor Bloom came out of the building.

17
00:00:53.598 --> 00:00:55.139
"Go away!

18
00:00:55.620 --> 00:00:56.740
You're scaring everyone!"

19
00:00:57.681 --> 00:00:59.042
King Trog glared at the mayor.

20
00:00:59.062 --> 00:01:01.464
"Are you the king here?"

21
00:01:02.724 --> 00:01:04.746
"I'm not a king," the mayor said.

22
00:01:04.766 --> 00:01:06.687
"But I am in charge here."

23
00:01:07.668 --> 00:01:09.589
King Trog looked at the City Hall building.

24
00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:11.891
Then he looked back at the mayor.

25
00:01:11.911 --> 00:01:14.373
"I rule this kingdom now.

26
00:01:14.713 --> 00:01:16.554
Go back in your cave!"

27
00:01:17.435 --> 00:01:19.036
King Trog swung his club.

28
00:01:19.056 --> 00:01:23.199
"Ahh!" Mayor Bloom ran back into the building.

29
00:01:24.260 --> 00:01:26.001
King Trog pounded his chest again.

30
00:01:26.021 --> 00:01:29.444
"I'm the king of everything!"

31
00:01:30.664 --> 00:01:32.485
"You're not my king!"

32
00:01:32.905 --> 00:01:33.685
a woman shouted.

33
00:01:33.705 --> 00:01:36.126
"Yeah!" a man yelled.

34
00:01:36.146 --> 00:01:37.786
"I didn't vote for you!

35
00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:39.707
I voted for Mayor Bloom!"

36
00:01:39.727 --> 00:01:44.828
"Grarg!" King Trog grew furious.

37
00:01:45.548 --> 00:01:48.749
He jumped off the steps, swung his club, and smashed a car.

38
00:01:48.769 --> 00:01:53.170
"Hey!" a man said.

39
00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:55.591
"I just bought that car!"

40
00:01:55.611 --> 00:01:59.732
"Grarg!" King Trog swung his club again.

41
00:02:01.368 --> 00:02:02.349
"Ahh!" The man ran away.

42
00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.391
Roxy landed in front of the caveman.

43
00:02:05.411 --> 00:02:07.693
"That's enough, Trog!

44
00:02:08.334 --> 00:02:09.575
You're not the king here!

45
00:02:10.276 --> 00:02:11.557
Stop scaring people!"

46
00:02:11.577 --> 00:02:15.860
"Grarg!" King Trog swung his club at Roxy.

47
00:02:16.801 --> 00:02:17.902
She blocked it with her arm.

48
00:02:18.783 --> 00:02:20.084
King Trog's mouth hung open.

49
00:02:21.064 --> 00:02:23.567
"You have strong powers."

50
00:02:24.928 --> 00:02:27.270
"Yes, I do," Roxy said.

51
00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:29.872
King Trog charged toward Roxy.

52
00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:31.881
His club swung wildly.

53
00:02:32.822 --> 00:02:34.483
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

54
00:02:35.144 --> 00:02:38.607
Whiz-hoo! King Trog's club exploded.

55
00:02:40.869 --> 00:02:42.230
The caveman stomped his foot.

56
00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.132
"How dare you destroy my club!

57
00:02:46.053 --> 00:02:47.354
I'm the king!

58
00:02:47.814 --> 00:02:50.336
Everyone must bow down to me!"

59
00:02:50.356 --> 00:02:52.959
"Yes!" someone shouted.

60
00:02:52.979 --> 00:02:55.421
"Bow down to my master!"

61
00:02:56.361 --> 00:02:57.242
Roxy looked over.

62
00:02:57.262 --> 00:02:59.304
"Professor Beard!"

63
00:03:00.316 --> 00:03:02.017
Just then King Trog grabbed her.

64
00:03:02.037 --> 00:03:06.478
"Grr!" Roxy tried to wriggle free.

65
00:03:07.038 --> 00:03:08.658
But the caveman was too strong.

66
00:03:08.678 --> 00:03:10.919
"Good job, Master!"

67
00:03:11.279 --> 00:03:12.179
Professor Beard said.

68
00:03:12.199 --> 00:03:13.980
"You really are powerful!

69
00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.220
Will you still share your treasure with me?"

70
00:03:16.901 --> 00:03:18.461
King Trog ignored the professor.

71
00:03:19.401 --> 00:03:21.542
The caveman pulled a metal band from his pouch.

72
00:03:22.862 --> 00:03:24.163
He placed it on Roxy's head.

73
00:03:25.103 --> 00:03:26.483
Roxy began to feel weak.

74
00:03:27.564 --> 00:03:28.764
King Trog smiled.

75
00:03:29.612 --> 00:03:33.418
"Powers, come to me!"
